# Keybinding cheatsheet data for omarchy-keys (Super+K).
# Curated mirror of DWM's Alt binds (config.h) + the Super binds (sxhkdrc).
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Keep in sync when either source changes.

──────── DWM · Alt (Mod1) ────────
Alt + Shift + Return       Terminal (ghostty)
Alt + p                    Run launcher (rofi run)
Alt + w                    Window switcher (rofi)
Alt + Shift + p            Run dialog (gmrun)
Alt + r                    Clipboard history (greenclip)
Alt + Shift + c            Close focused window
Alt + Return               Zoom / promote to master
Alt + Tab                  Focus next window
Alt + j / Alt + k          Focus next / previous
Alt + v                    Focus master
Alt + Shift + j / k        Move window down / up the stack
Alt + h / Alt + l          Shrink / grow master area
Alt + , / Alt + .          Focus monitor left / right
Alt + Shift + , / .        Send window to monitor left / right
Alt + space                Cycle layout
Alt + Shift + space        Toggle floating
Alt + t                    Push window back into tiling
Alt + m                    Toggle fullscreen
Alt + b                    Toggle bar
Alt + Shift + g            Toggle gaps
Alt + s                    Screenshot (full)
Alt + Shift + s            Screenshot (selection)
Alt + 1..9                 View tag / workspace
Alt + Shift + 1..9         Send window to tag
Alt + 0                    View all tags
Alt + Shift + q            Quit DWM

──────── Omarchy additions · Alt (Mod1) ────────
Alt + d                    App launcher (rofi drun, icon grid)
Alt + c                    Command menu (Apps/Capture/Style/Toggle/System/Power)
Alt + /                    This keybinding cheatsheet
Alt + x                    Power / session menu
# (Alt+p run launcher and Alt+r clipboard are existing DWM binds, listed above)
